Kontrol-ID is Kontrol's standalone secure web gateway, derived from the
E2Guardian 5.4 engine.  It combines explicit and transparent proxying, TLS
inspection and exceptions, policy groups, URL/category filtering, block pages,
logging and reporting in one managed product.

This independent port implements native Kerberos/SPNEGO and NTLMv2
authentication and is the development boundary for the remaining standalone
authentication modes.  It intentionally conflicts with the standard E2Guardian
engine because it preserves the established policy and configuration layout for
safe migration of existing installations.

Kontrol-ID is distributed under GPLv2 and retains the E2Guardian and
DansGuardian copyright and attribution requirements.
